5. Expected Results

Upon successful completion, the user will have a locally hosted AI-assisted programming environment consisting of three integrated software applications and one AI coding model.

The resulting system will provide the following advantages:

* Local Model Execution: Run the selected AI model locally through Ollama.
* Integrated AI Assistance: Access Qwen3-Coder through Cline directly inside VS Code.
* Automated Coding Support: Generate, modify, and analyze code using natural-language instructions.
* Project-Level Assistance: Allow the coding agent to work with multiple files within a development project.
* Greater Control: Manage the model and development environment locally, subject to the software’s permissions and configuration.
* Reduced Cloud Dependency: Avoid relying on a third-party hosted inference API for the configured local model workflow.

The ultimate objective is to create a practical AI programming environment in which users can interact with an AI coding model, develop software, and manage programming projects through a unified graphical interface.

